---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /index.html
title: Ben & Ben's Property Services | Dryer Vent Cleaning, Mowing & Landscaping
description: Ben & Ben's Property Services offers professional dryer vent
  cleaning, lawn mowing and landscaping, including garden design, sod
  installation, excavation and hardscaping. Reliable local property care. Call
  for a free quote.
keywords: dryer vent cleaning, lawn mowing, landscaping, garden design, sod
  installation, excavation, hardscaping, property services, yard maintenance
ogType: business.business
ogTitle: Ben & Ben's Property Services
ogDescription: Professional dryer vent cleaning, mowing and landscaping.
schemaType: localBusiness
schemaDescription: Professional dryer vent cleaning, lawn mowing and landscaping
  services, including garden design, sod installation, excavation and
  hardscaping.
makesOffer:
  - name: Dryer Vent Cleaning
    href: /dryer-vent-cleaning.html
  - name: Lawn Mowing
    href: /lawn-mowing.html
  - name: Landscaping
    href: /landscaping.html
heroHeading: Reliable Property Care, Right Here in Halifax
heroText: "Dryer vents, lawns, gardens: the stuff you keep meaning to get to.
  We'll just take care of it for you."
storyPhoto: images/benandben.jpg
storyPhotoAlt: Ben and Ben, founders of Ben & Ben's Property Services, standing
  together in front of a landscaped garden
storyEyebrow: Our Story
storyHeading: Meet The Bens
storyParagraph1: We started working together as student labourers for the city
  in 2022, where we gained valuable experience in landscaping and property
  maintenance. In 2023, we decided to take what we'd learned and build something
  of our own, that's how Ben & Ben's Property Services began.
storyParagraph2: "From day one, our goal has been simple: deliver reliable,
  high-quality service and treat every property like it's our own. Through hard
  work, teamwork, and a commitment to doing things the right way, we've grown
  steadily across HRM. We take pride in clear communication, consistent results,
  and building lasting relationships with our clients."
storyParagraph3: For us, it's more than just property care; it's about earning
  trust and creating outdoor spaces our clients are proud of.
servicesHeading: What We Do
servicesText: Here's what we get called for most. Don't see your thing on the
  list? Ask anyway.
services:
  - icon: "&#127788;"
    title: Dryer Vent Cleaning
    text: Nobody thinks about their dryer vent until it's a problem. We'll clean it
      out so it never gets there.
    href: dryer-vent-cleaning.html
  - icon: "&#127793;"
    title: Lawn Mowing
    text: A lawn that actually looks mowed, every single time. Weekly, biweekly, or
      just the one cut before company shows up.
    href: lawn-mowing.html
  - icon: "&#127795;"
    title: Landscaping
    text: Tired flower bed? Full yard overhaul? Garden design, sod, digging,
      stonework, we do it all ourselves.
    href: landscaping.html
workHeading: Our Work
workText: Just some of the things we do
workPhotos:
  - src: images/work-1.jpeg
    alt: Freshly mulched garden beds with evergreen shrubs around a Halifax home
  - src: images/work-2.jpeg
    alt: New landscape bed with black mulch and white stone accents at a new build
  - src: images/work-3.jpeg
    alt: Freshly striped, mowed lawn at a large Halifax property
  - src: images/work-4.jpeg
    alt: New sod and mulch beds installed in a front yard
featuresHeading: Why Choose Ben & Ben's
features:
  - icon: "&#9989;"
    title: Locally Owned
    text: We're locally owned and operated. We live here, same as you.
  - icon: "&#128176;"
    title: Fair Pricing
    text: You'll know the price before we touch a thing. No "surprise" charges later.
  - icon: "&#9200;"
    title: On Time
    text: We say when we're coming, and we show up then.
  - icon: "&#11088;"
    title: Quality Work
    text: We treat every yard like the neighbors are going to notice, because they
      usually do.
stats:
  - number: 3+
    label: Years in Service
  - number: 150+
    label: Customers
  - number: 100%
    label: Satisfaction
ctaHeading: Ready to Get Started?
ctaText: Call or message us today for a free, no-obligation quote.
---
  <!-- ===== Hero ===== -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>{{ heroHeading }}</h1>
      <p>{{ heroText }}</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="contact.html" class="btn">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phone1Link }}" class="btn btn-outline">Call {{ site.phone1 }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Our Story ===== -->
  <section id="our-story">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-story">
        <div class="about-story-photo">
          <img src="{{ storyPhoto }}" alt="{{ storyPhotoAlt }}" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-story-text">
          <p class="eyebrow">{{ storyEyebrow }}</p>
          <h2>{{ storyHeading }}</h2>
          <p>{{ storyParagraph1 }}</p>
          <p>{{ storyParagraph2 }}</p>
          <p>{{ storyParagraph3 }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Services overview ===== -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>{{ servicesHeading }}</h2>
        <p>{{ servicesText }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        {% for service in services %}
        <article class="card">
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ service.icon | safe }}</span>
          <h3>{{ service.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ service.text }}</p>
          <p><a href="{{ service.href }}">Learn More &rarr;</a></p>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:40px;">
        <a href="services.html" class="btn">View All Services</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Our Work ===== -->
  <section class="alt-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>{{ workHeading }}</h2>
        <p>{{ workText }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="work-gallery">
        {% for photo in workPhotos %}
        <figure class="work-photo">
          <img src="{{ photo.src }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Why choose us ===== -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>{{ featuresHeading }}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="features">
        {% for feature in features %}
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ feature.icon | safe }}</div>
          <h3>{{ feature.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ feature.text }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Stats band ===== -->
  <section class="stats-band">
    <div class="stats-numbers">
      {% for stat in stats %}
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-number">{{ stat.number }}</div>
        <div class="stat-label">{{ stat.label }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== CTA band ===== -->
  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>{{ ctaHeading }}</h2>
      <p>{{ ctaText }}</p>
      <div class="phone-row">
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phone1Link }}">&#128222; {{ site.phone1 }}</a>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phone2Link }}">&#128222; {{ site.phone2 }}</a>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:24px;">
        <a href="contact.html" class="btn">Request a Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
